# Headless tour of selection (cargo xtask sim-smoke): open the dropdown and pick "Cairo" (the
# roller spins to it), swipe to the Lists tab and on to the Tiles tab, then open the About box
# with the "i" button and close it with its close button.
wait 300
shot pickers
tap 73 112
wait 300
shot dropdown_open
tap 73 185
wait 500
shot city_picked
drag 260 200 40 200 250
wait 800
shot lists
drag 260 200 40 200 250
wait 800
shot tiles
tap 298 20
wait 400
shot about_open
tap 258 63
wait 400
shot about_closed
